+def container_gpu_indices(container):
+    """The HOST GPU indices a container is pinned to, from docker inspect.
+
+    Channels, in order:
+      1. HostConfig.DeviceRequests device_ids — the compose `devices:`
+         form. A request with only a `count` (the runtime picks the
+         cards) is not resolvable and is skipped.
+      2. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES — the in-container mask; the ground truth
+         under CDI runtimes, which ignore NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES.
+      3. NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES — what the classic nvidia runtime
+         exposes into the container.
+    The estate launcher sets (2) and (3) to the same value, so they
+    agree; (2) is checked first so a CDI pin resolves to the mask.
+
+    Returns a sorted list of host indices, or None when the container is
+    unknown, docker is unavailable, or no channel pins a card — the
+    caller then falls back to whole-rig and says so."""
